{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅雨に入りましたね!\n梅雨は暑くもなく寒くもないので意外と好きです☔️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅雨の時期は、映画を観に行くのが楽しそう!\n今は、映画の席がネットから予約が出来るんですね。\n便利そうだからやってみようかなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りこぴ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP5HS2AAC33HEQPFG75EXT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りこぴの着ている服が全部タイプ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かき氷食べたよー!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP5JQSXC8RMNATSXB11X9K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP5KSH6AJPTHQK9E9FJTQ2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n美味しかった!\n最近の朝ごはんは、たこ焼きが多いよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}